        <mxCell id="c149" value="&lt;b&gt;Event katalog yang muncul, berurutan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;run_started → step_started measure → token → tool_call_started / tool_call_finished (stockbit_status, quote, history) → step_started explain → news, stockbit_actions → step_started deep_dive (bila perlu) → broker, bandar, foreign → step_started assess → tool_call_started submit_memo → step_started memo → approval_required (approval_1, revision 0) → setelah keputusan: tool_call_finished submit_memo → done atau error. Revisi mengulang bagian akhir tanpa step_started baru.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tombol Hentikan&lt;/b&gt;: stop-button.js → InvestigationController.Stop() :219 → InvestigationService.StopAsync() → RunPump.Stop() :45 membatalkan token → adapter menutup tool yang masih terbuka (status error, kode cancelled) → done cancelled. Untuk LangGraph dan ADK lewat POST /runs/{id}/cancel." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="5240" width="1000" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
